<title>ZIMBABWE: SOCCER-CAMEROON BEAT ZIMBABWE IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CAMEROON BEAT ZIMBABWE IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a World Cup soccer African zone group four qualifier on Sunday:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe  1 Cameroon 2 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe - Edelberth Dinha 86</p>
<p>Cameroon - Patrick Mboma 48, 58</p>
<p>Att: 20,000</p>
